  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nDecoding signs:\n\n \n \n\n Given\n ×\n -\n +\n ÷\n \n \n\n Replaced by\n +\n ÷\n ×\n -\n \n \n\nGiven: 18 + 6 × 3 - 9 ÷ 3 = ?\n\n18 + 6 × 3 - 9 ÷ 3 = ? ⇒ 18 × 6 + 3 ÷ 9 - 3 = ?\n\n⇒ 18 × 6 + __**3 **____**÷**____** 9**__ - 3 = ?\n\n⇒ __**18 ×**____** 6**__ + 0.33 - 3 = ?\n\n⇒ __**108**____** +**____** 0.33**__ - 3 = ?\n\n⇒ __**108.33 -**____** 3**__ = ?\n\n⇒ 105.33 = ?\n\nHence, \"Option 4\" is the correct answer.",
